import ../../../ui/source_language.dl

to [prepare test source query] {a pointer to UI source query:query} [in] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    set JSON member (JSON flag "prepared" is true) in (query's parameters)
    set JSON member (JSON text "source" is (document's source)) in (query's parameters)

set document to a UI source document named "main.dl" at "file:///workspace/main.dl" prefixed by "" containing "current" using UI CPU analysis
set client to a UI language client rooted at "file:///workspace"
set client's project to document's project
set client's model to the UI language model for document in client
set client's phase to 7
set client's opened to true
set client's uri to document's uri
set client's context to document's context
set client's project context to document's project's context
set client's project revision to document's project's revision
set client's profiles to the compact JSON form of (document's project's profiles)
set client's snapshot to document's source
set client's revision to document's revision
set client's version to 1
set document's analyzed revision to document's revision
set document's analyzed project revision to document's project's revision
set parameters to a JSON object containing [JSON flag "prepared" is false]
set query to request UI source feature "example/prepared" with parameters parameters in document
set query's parameters factory to (the function named "prepare test source query $ in $") as a pointer
set generation to query's generation
require condition ((the JSON boolean named "prepared" in (query's parameters)) = false) reporting "A source parameter preparer ran before dispatch."
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 0.0 seconds
set payload to the JSON member named "params" in (the JSON member named "message" in (work's payload))
require condition ((the JSON boolean named "prepared" in payload) and ((the JSON text named "source" in payload) = "current")) reporting "A prepared query did not serialize its fresh parameters."
require condition (query's generation = generation) reporting "Preparing query parameters changed the query identity."
free work's payload
set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 12, JSON child "result" is (a new JSON-RPC null)]]
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
set same to request UI source feature "example/prepared" with parameters parameters in document
free parameters
require condition (same = query) reporting "Preparing a query discarded its bounded feature slot."
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 0.0 seconds
set payload to the JSON member named "params" in (the JSON member named "message" in (work's payload))
require condition ((the JSON boolean named "prepared" in payload) = false) reporting "A reused query retained its preceding parameter preparer."
free work's payload
free UI language client client
free UI source project (document's project)
print line "Source query parameters refresh at dispatch without changing identity or leaking a factory into the next request."
